																		Author Post - S.C.P. Lovecraft
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcaroll" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3828846); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3828846&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200798" alt="DrCaroll" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3828846)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcaroll" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3828846); return false;" >DrCaroll</a></span> <span class="odate time_1541440782 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">05 Nov 2018 17:59</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4050679">
									

<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><em>I'm starting to get the feeling that I'm reading Lovecraftian nonfiction.</em></p>
</div>
<p>After a bit of brainstorming, I thought of H.P. Lovecraft for the 4k contest (yes, we started that long ago). The original concept for this article was very similar to the one we have now, but I just had the skip be Providence rather than an event that takes us to an extradimensional Providence. I wanted to go for something creepy yet historical while using the concept of H.P. Lovecraft essentially being nonfiction, so who did I go to?</p>
<p>The legend himself, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-gears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(172464); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=172464&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541441005" alt="Dr Gears" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=172464)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-gears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(172464); return false;">Dr Gears</a></span>.</p>
<p>This is actually a collaboration between Gears and I. Without him, this article wouldn't have had as much fine tuning and creep factor as it did. It's been an absolutely fantastic journey working with Gears and I wouldn't have wanted this to turn out any different than what it is.</p>
<p>Many thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541441005" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;">JackalRelated</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/prototype-toaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3512728); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3512728&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541441005" alt="Prototype_Toaster" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3512728)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/prototype-toaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3512728); return false;">Prototype_Toaster</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1856789); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541441005" alt="Dr Aers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1856789); return false;">Dr Aers</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1705184&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541441005" alt="Mortos" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1705184)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;">Mortos</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541441005" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span> for critique and some more finetuning.</p>
<p>Image sources are <a href="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Dexter_asylum.jpg/1200px-Dexter_asylum.jpg">here</a> and <a href="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/Cthulhu_sketch_by_Lovecraft.jpg">here</a> with both being licensed under Creative Commons.</p>
<p>You can find more of my work <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/researcher-caroll-s-personnel-file">here</a> and more of Gears' work <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-gears-s-personnel-file">here.</a></p>
<p>Thanks for reading!</p>

