<p>Holy mother.</p>
<p>The fact that you turned all of Lovecraftian mythology into an SCP is impressive. And while the writing itself could use a little more work, this is a pretty stellar<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-994538-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-994538-1')">1</a></sup> article.</p>
<p>Also, I'm really glad that someone here knows about The King in Yellow:</p>
