<p>I was aware that a decent amount of people would see the article like this, and I completely understand why.</p>
<p>I would like to say, however, the article’s not intended to be entirely accurate to Lovecraft’s works in the real world. I felt like just having them be exactly like Lovecraft’s actual portrayal was just making spooky scary murder monsters instead of things that deliberately drive people crazy and are attempting to enter our world through people’s dreams. Doing this just gave me more to work with.</p>

